<view class="page" wx:if="{{loading}}">
  <view class="empty">正在生成今天的碎片…</view>
</view>

<view class="page" wx:elif="{{error}}">
  <view class="card center">
    <view class="card-title">这次没有生成成功</view>
    <view class="muted" style="margin: 12rpx 0 28rpx;">{{error}}</view>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onEdit">回到记录页</button>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="page" wx:elif="{{missing}}">
  <view class="card center">
    <view class="card-title">今天还没有记录</view>
    <view class="muted" style="margin: 12rpx 0 28rpx;">先花 5 秒选一个状态和一个场景，碎片会立刻出现。</view>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onEdit">去记录</button>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="page" wx:else>
  <view wx:if="{{savedText}}" class="tag" style="margin-bottom: 16rpx;">{{savedText}}</view>
  <view class="section-title">{{dateLabel}} · 今日碎片</view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="muted small">今天的角色更像</view>
    <view class="hero-label">{{label}}</view>
    <view class="muted" style="font-size: 28rpx;">{{explanation}}</view>

    <view class="divider"></view>
    <view class="section-title" style="margin-bottom: 8rpx;">DATA ANCHORS</view>
    <view class="anchor-list">
      <view wx:for="{{anchors}}" wx:key="*this" class="anchor">{{item}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{note}}">
    <view class="section-title" style="margin-bottom: 8rpx;">你写下的一句话</view>
    <view style="font-size: 28rpx;">{{note}}</view>
    <view class="muted small" style="margin-top: 12rpx;">这句话只保存在本机，不会进入生成文案。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">还差一点，就能看到更大的图景</view>
    <view class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 24rpx;">最近 7 天满 3 天可看周快照；当月满 10 天可看月角色卡。</view>
    <view class="row" style="gap: 16rpx;">
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" style="flex: 1;" bindtap="onOpenWeekly">看本周</button>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" style="flex: 1;" bindtap="onOpenMonthly">看月卡</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn btn-link" bindtap="onEdit">修改今天的记录</button>
  <view class="footer-note">碎片只描述今天的记录和近期共现，不是性格判断，也不构成医疗建议。</view>
</view>
